---
/**
 * @file Renders an accessible static diagram of the portfolio build and delivery path.
 * Functions: none; semantic figure markup.
 * Variables: diagram labels embedded in SVG and figcaption.
 * Line locations: see docs/CODE_INDEX.md for the generated symbol index.
 */
---

<figure class="architecture-figure">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 880 270"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="architecture-title architecture-description"
  >
    <title id="architecture-title">Static portfolio data flow</title>
    <desc id="architecture-description">
      Reviewed case studies and cached repository metadata are validated at build time, rendered to
      static pages and a search index, then deployed to GitHub Pages.
    </desc>
    <defs>
      <marker id="arrow" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" refX="7" refY="4.5" orient="auto">
        <path d="M0 0 9 4.5 0 9Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>
    <g class="diagram-lines" marker-end="url(#arrow)">
      <path d="M190 74H330"></path>
      <path d="M190 196H330"></path>
      <path d="M550 135H690"></path>
    </g>
    <g class="diagram-node">
      <rect x="20" y="28" width="170" height="92" rx="12"></rect>
      <text x="40" y="64">
        CASE STUDIES
      </text>
      <text class="diagram-detail" x="40" y="90">
        Schema-checked Markdown
      </text>
    </g>
    <g class="diagram-node">
      <rect x="20" y="150" width="170" height="92" rx="12"></rect>
      <text x="40" y="186">
        GITHUB CACHE
      </text>
      <text class="diagram-detail" x="40" y="212">
        Reviewed JSON snapshot
      </text>
    </g>
    <g class="diagram-node diagram-node--accent">
      <rect x="330" y="74" width="220" height="122" rx="12"></rect>
      <text x="354" y="116">
        ASTRO BUILD
      </text>
      <text class="diagram-detail" x="354" y="143">
        Validation · pages · index
      </text>
      <text class="diagram-detail" x="354" y="169">
        No runtime API dependency
      </text>
    </g>
    <g class="diagram-node">
      <rect x="690" y="89" width="170" height="92" rx="12"></rect>
      <text x="710" y="125">
        GITHUB PAGES
      </text>
      <text class="diagram-detail" x="710" y="151">
        Static, cached, portable
      </text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    Content and repository facts are validated before deployment; visitors receive static HTML and a
    small precomputed search index.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
